# artifacts/ and frontend/dist/ are intentionally tracked, not ignored.
#
# This repo ships a working snapshot: a fresh clone runs immediately with
# real numbers (no ML pipeline run, no `npm install`, one process, one
# command) instead of showing an untrained placeholder or a broken screen
# until someone finds and runs the right setup commands. `make reproduce`
# still regenerates every one of these files byte-for-byte from seed 42 --
# shipping the snapshot does not weaken that claim, it just means nobody has
# to run the regeneration before they're allowed to look at the product.
